    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that, but \"potential gaps\" might be a bit too vague for their CTO. He's pretty technical and will probably ask for specific examples of what we're actually seeing in the logs or where they are specifically vulnerable. \n\nIf the audit didn't actually find any active vulnerabilities or weak points, what specific \"emerging threats\" or types of attacks should I tell him we are seeing that necessitate the upgrade? I need something concrete to justify the extra spend.",
